{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_10","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/zsh -lc 'command -v flutter; command -v dart; cat README.md; ls -la'","aggregated_output":"/Users/valentinakoniukhova/development/flutter/bin/flutter\n/Users/valentinakoniukhova/development/flutter/bin/dart\n# kredito\n\nFlutter app (iOS + Android) for a consumer loan broker. The user registers\nwith an email and a phone number, picks the amount they want to borrow, accepts\nthe terms and gets a list of offers from partner banks. Two screens so far:\n`lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`.\n\nAnalytics is PostHog (`posthog_flutter`), set up in `lib/analytics.dart` and\n`lib/main.dart`; screen views come from `PosthogObserver`. We are on the\nPostHog free tier. Product events are defined in `docs/EVENTS.md`; the\nscreens do not send any of them yet. Send events through `Analytics.capture`\nso the key and host stay in one place.\ntotal 24\ndrwx------    8 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   256 Oct 20 20:31 .\ndrwxrwxrwt  242 root                 wheel  7744 Oct 20 20:31 ..\ndrwxr-xr-x   12 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   384 Oct 20 20:31 .git\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   656 Oct 20 20:31 README.md\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    44 Oct 20 20:31 analysis_options.yaml\ndrwxr-xr-x    3 valentinakoniukhova  wheel    96 Oct 20 20:31 docs\ndrwxr-xr-x    5 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   160 Oct 20 20:31 lib\n-rw-r--r--    1 valentinakoniukhova  wheel   316 Oct 20 20:31 pubspec.yaml\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
